      "writtenOn": "2024-04-05T19:55:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the assert isn\u0027t hard to add I think it could be a good safety check. I don\u0027t think we need to checking the other direction, especially with the long term design plan.",
      "parentUuid": "973a3832_e93dbd54",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 47,
        "startChar": 29,
